00:10:34.266 --> 00:10:35.301
ASSEMBLY BILL 3072 ON BEHALF OF

00:10:35.368 --> 00:10:37.403
ASSEMBLY MEMBER PETRIE-NORRIS TO

00:10:37.470 --> 00:10:39.972
HELP KEEP KIDS SAFE DURING

00:10:40.039 --> 00:10:40.906
CUSTODY BATTLES. CURRENT LAW

00:10:40.973 --> 00:10:44.243
GENERALLY LIMITS WHEN A COURT

00:10:44.310 --> 00:10:45.478
CAN MAKE AN EX PARTE CUSTODY

00:10:45.544 --> 00:10:46.512
ORDER, EXCEPT FOR INSTANCES

00:10:46.579 --> 00:10:48.214
WHERE THERE IS AN IMMEDIATE RISK

00:10:48.280 --> 00:10:51.717
OF HARM TO A CHILD. AB 3072 DOES

00:10:51.784 --> 00:10:54.687
TWO THINGS. FIRST, IT SIMPLY

00:10:54.754 --> 00:10:55.821
REQUIRES THAT WHEN A COURT IS

00:10:55.888 --> 00:10:58.657
DETERMINING IF THERE IS A RISK

00:10:58.724 --> 00:10:59.725
OF IMMEDIATE HARM, THEY SHOULD

00:10:59.792 --> 00:11:00.459
CONSIDER A PARENT'S ILLEGAL.

00:11:00.526 --> 00:11:04.030
THEY SHOULD CONSIDER THE ACCESS

00:11:04.096 --> 00:11:05.197
TO ILLEGAL FIREARMS. SECOND, THE

00:11:05.264 --> 00:11:07.800
BILL AUTHORIZES THE COURT TO

00:11:07.867 --> 00:11:08.801
CONSIDER WHETHER THE BEST

00:11:08.868 --> 00:11:09.902
INTEREST OF THE CHILD IS BETTER

00:11:09.969 --> 00:11:11.003
SERVED BY LIMITING THE

00:11:11.070 --> 00:11:12.905
SUPERVISION, OR BY ORDERING

00:11:12.972 --> 00:11:15.808
SUPERVISED OR VIRTUAL

00:11:15.875 --> 00:11:16.909
SITUATIONS. THERE IS A CASE IN

00:11:16.976 --> 00:11:18.177
SACRAMENTO WHERE A MOTHER LOST

00:11:18.244 --> 00:11:20.212
HER THREE LITTLE GIRLS, AND SHE

00:11:20.279 --> 00:11:21.747
PLEADED WITH THE COURTS. SHE

00:11:21.814 --> 00:11:23.816
KNEW THAT THE HUSBAND EX-HUSBAND

00:11:23.883 --> 00:11:26.752
WAS THREATENING TO KILL THEM,

00:11:26.819 --> 00:11:27.853
HARM HIMSELF, AND THERE WAS A

00:11:27.920 --> 00:11:29.588
LOT OF INSTANCES WHERE THOSE

00:11:29.655 --> 00:11:31.657
THREE LITTLE GIRLS SHOULD HAVE

00:11:31.724 --> 00:11:32.758
BEEN REMOVED, BUT THEY DID NOT.

00:11:32.825 --> 00:11:33.793
THE COURTS DID NOT LISTEN. AND

00:11:33.859 --> 00:11:34.927
OF COURSE, THE THREE LITTLE

00:11:34.994 --> 00:11:35.828
GIRLS WERE FATALLY SHOT. SO

00:11:35.895 --> 00:11:36.796
UNFORTUNATELY, WE NEED TO

00:11:36.862 --> 00:11:38.998
IMPLEMENT THIS BILL TO ENSURE

00:11:39.065 --> 00:11:41.300
THAT THESE PRECIOUS CHILDREN ARE

00:11:41.367 --> 00:11:42.368
PROTECTED. THIS BILL HAS NO

00:11:42.435 --> 00:11:43.369
OPPOSITION. I RESPECTFULLY ASK

00:11:43.436 --> 00:11:45.905
FOR YOUR AYE VOTE. THANK YOU.

